# Expose effective sandbox grants to the agent

Consider giving the agent an accurate preview of its sandbox access so it can plan around restrictions. This combines the dynamic grant-message and project-environment suggestions.

Suggestions:
- Check whether project/environment or another existing hook can supply enough context without dynamic system prompts.
- Consider baseline policy, session grants, and explicit denies rather than implying grants describe all effective access.
- Investigate how context stays accurate after /sandbox updates and session resume.
- Reuse the resolved session profile where possible rather than creating a second policy representation.

Related: harness/dynamic-prompts.

